<mxCell id="x31" value="AssumeRole + ExternalId" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#545B64;fontStyle=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="691" y="742" width="138" height="13" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t32" value="The reader role trusts only the two collector Lambda roles and requires an ExternalId. The bucket policy accepts vended logs from the monitored account and denies reads of its raw logs. terraform plan fails if the source is another account and manage_delivery_sources = true, cloudtrail_mode = &quot;new&quot; or source_role_arn is missing. After the first apply run one FULL_REFRESH on every dataset (the first ingestion races IAM propagation)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#F2F3F3;strokeColor=#879596;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="g17"><mxGeometry x="30" y="830" width="1000" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
