<mxCell id="t16" value="Order, without losing a day of data: (1) apply examples/cross-account/migrate-in in the monitored account with manage_delivery_sources = false, reusing the 3 existing sources. (2) in the source root add local = &amp;lt;new destination&amp;gt; to delivery_destinations and apply: every new event reaches both instances. (3) copy history from the collector bucket: the enriched*/ prefixes and qs_metadata/spice_capacity/, never the raw AWSLogs/ prefix; refresh SPICE. (4) compare row counts of both dashboards for the same days. (5) remove collector from delivery_destinations, set create_reader_role = false, apply; destroy the collector root." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#ED7100;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="g3"><mxGeometry x="20" y="770" width="1100" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
