<mxCell id="t23" value="Keeps running unchanged during the transition, so both dashboards can be compared. Vended logs are not retroactive: history starts on the day the first deliveries were created." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#F2F3F3;strokeColor=#879596;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="g20"><mxGeometry x="20" y="280" width="630" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t24" value="Not tested yet: the cross-account S3 copy (needs a bucket policy on the new bucket, or a temporary read grant from the collector side) and the new Glue tables reading the copied Parquet (same prefixes and partition layout, so expected to work). user_attributes is a snapshot and is rebuilt by the first user-sync." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FDECEC;strokeColor=#D13212;fontColor=#B0281A;" vertex="1" parent="g20"><mxGeometry x="20" y="480" width="630" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
