<mxCell id="t15" value="A plain single-account instance as in the upstream sample (source_account_id unset): no cross-account role, no ExternalId. The delivery sources are still the ones created in phase 1, managed by the source root with delivery_destinations = { local = ... } and create_reader_role = false. Deploy in the Region where Quick emits its logs, so the destination and the bucket share a Region. History before the migration exists only because of the copy step on page 2." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#F2F3F3;strokeColor=#879596;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="g3"><mxGeometry x="20" y="590" width="1320" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
